{"id":53149,"date":"2026-07-09T05:49:44","date_gmt":"2026-07-09T04:49:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=53149"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:36:00","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:36:00","slug":"trail-mosteiro-de-arnoso","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-mosteiro-de-arnoso\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>11 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, junto ao monumental <strong>Mosteiro de Arnoso<\/strong> e \u00e0 Praia Fluvial de Arnoso Santa Eul\u00e1lia, no concelho de <strong>Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Braga<\/strong>. Integrada no Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Famalic\u00e3o, a prova desvenda trilhos hist\u00f3ricos, linhas de \u00e1gua e ecovias do rio Este e Guisande.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o QUEBRARITMO<\/strong>, o evento apresenta as vertentes competitivas de <strong>Trail Longo (20 km com 900m D+)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Curto (12 km com 500m D+)<\/strong>, a <strong>Caminhada (8 km)<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Kids<\/strong> gratuito para as crian\u00e7as, com oferta de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial para todos os atletas.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:10<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; pa