tween; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Kids<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:10<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">0.00 \u20ac<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando se realiza o Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 09h10 (Kids), 09h20 (Trail 20 km), 09h45 (Trail 12 km) e 10h00 (Caminhada) no Mosteiro de Arnoso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica localizado o centro do evento e meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida localiza-se junto ao Mosteiro de Arnoso e a meta na apraz\u00edvel Praia Fluvial de Arnoso Santa Eul\u00e1lia, em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova est\u00e1 inserida em algum circuito competitivo?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o evento pontua oficialmente para o Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos participantes?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, seguro desportivo e banhos quentes.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 4 de outubro de 2026 atrav\u00e9s da plataforma SincTime (www.sinctime.com).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Mosteiro de Arnoso, Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o\", \"addressRegion\": \"Braga\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o QUEBRARITMO\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Trail Mosteiro de Arnoso 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o realiza-se no domingo, 11 de outubro de 2026, com partidas a partir das 09h10 (Kids), 09h20 (Trail 20 km), 09h45 (Trail 12 km) e 10h00 (Caminhada) no Mosteiro de Arnoso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica localizado o centro do evento e meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida localiza-se junto ao Mosteiro de Arnoso e a meta na apraz\u00edvel Praia Fluvial de Arnoso Santa Eul\u00e1lia, em Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova est\u00e1 inserida em algum circuito competitivo?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o evento pontua oficialmente para o Campeonato Concelhio de Trail de Vila Nova de Famalic\u00e3o.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o dos participantes?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, seguro desportivo e banhos quentes.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 4 de outubro de 2026 atrav\u00e9s da plataforma SincTime (www.sinctime.com).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66239,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-53149","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-arnoso-vila-nova-de-famalicao","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-mosteiro-de-arnoso-2026.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/53149","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/w